Z||000001||Haze_Performance||08-23-2001||01:35 AM||||I would think if someone just removed there air cleaner box & put on a K&N cone filter, They would get the same results. (Cheaper to)  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Just my 2 1/2 cents...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>-Haze  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR><A HREF="http://www.ws6fiero.com" TARGET=_blank>          <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/indyclick.gif">          <BR></A>||||reg||10
